       CHRDRV <_s_t_r_i_n_g>
           Character device driver name resolved by _/_p_r_o_c_/_d_e_v_i_c_e_s.

       COMMAND <_s_t_r_i_n_g>
           Command of the process opening the file.

       DELETED <_b_o_o_l_e_a_n>
